  '분모가 정해지지 않았습니다(결정 qi.autoMeasure.denominator)': ['The denominator has not been decided (decision qi.autoMeasure.denominator)', '分母が決まっていません(決定 qi.autoMeasure.denominator)', 'لم يُحدد المقام (القرار qi.autoMeasure.denominator)'],
